  <h2>Read a shortlist whose references matter</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Nia’s fictional workshop note</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">We need the trainer who teaches evening classes because the workshop begins at 7:00 p.m. I recommend Lena Ortiz, whose recent sessions received strong accessibility feedback. Please reserve the projector Omar tested on Tuesday, not the older unit that loses its connection after ten minutes. We also need the room where the large tables are stored. The volunteers who completed first-aid training can supervise the activity stations; the other volunteers can welcome guests.</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You used only Nia’s note to identify the trainer, possession link, reliable projector, room, and trained volunteer subset.">
