      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="the projector Omar tested on Tuesday" data-hint="The note contrasts Omar’s tested unit with an older unit that loses its connection." data-fix="Nia asks for the projector Omar tested on Tuesday."><p class="quiz-question">3. Which projector should the team reserve?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="the projector Omar tested on Tuesday">the projector Omar tested on Tuesday</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="the older unit that loses its connection">the older unit that loses its connection</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="any projector without checking it">any projector without checking it</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="only the volunteers who completed first-aid training" data-hint="The defining clause selects the trained subset for supervision." data-fix="Only the volunteers who completed first-aid training can supervise the stations."><p class="quiz-question">4. Who can supervise the activity stations?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="only the volunteers who completed first-aid training">only the volunteers who completed first-aid training</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="all guests who enter the building">all guests who enter the building</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="only volunteers who did not complete the training">only volunteers who did not complete the training</button></div></div>
